# Pages & Content

## Positioning
Evidence-driven Global Talent Visa guidance for founders, engineers, researchers, designers, product leaders, marketers, scientists, and creators. Never use “immigration agency,” “visa mill,” or low-trust sales copy.

## Conversion
Every section should support trust or next action. Dual CTAs where appropriate. Case studies emphasize challenge → strategy → outcome.

## SEO & HTML
- Export `metadata` / `generateMetadata` (title template, description, Open Graph, Twitter)
- Semantic landmarks (`header`, `main`, `nav`, `footer`, `section` with headings)
- One `h1` per page; logical heading hierarchy
- JSON-LD for Organization/WebSite on home; case-study structured data on detail pages
- Accessible controls: ARIA labels, keyboard focus, accordion semantics

## Auth pages
Login/Register are dummy UI only — no API calls, `preventDefault` on submit.
